lt;p&gt;My mission is to make Generative AI more efficient: from more efficient foundational models, to more efficient&#10;agentic workflows. My efforts can largely be grouped under the theme of AI for AI Systems. I draw from my core background in Reinforcement Learning, Imitation Learning, Planning&#10;and Combinatorial Optimization to aid me in this mission. I am an architect at &lt;a href="https://www.microsoft.com"&gt;Microsoft&lt;/a&gt; working on using evolutionary search and reinforcement learning to optimize kernels for Nvidia, AMD and MAIA (Microsoft AI Accelerator) hardware.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>J Andrew Bagnell</title><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/j-andrew-bagnell/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/j-andrew-bagnell/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Martial Hebert</title><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/martial-hebert/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/martial-hebert/</guid><description/></item><item><title/><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Name "Dilip Arumugam"</title><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/name-dilip-arumugam/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/name-dilip-arumugam/</guid><description/></item><item><title/><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Name "Khanh Nguyen"</title><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/name-khanh-nguyen/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://debadeepta.com/author/name-khanh-nguyen/</guid><description/></item><item><title/><link>https://debadeepta.com/author/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2020 02:45:05 +0000</pubDate><guid>h